 "size": 18.5, "font": "IM FELL English", "color": "#33261e", "ls": 0.01, "runs": [["Set the numbers about the figure without making them agree. The upper chambers contain waits. The lower contain occasions on which a thing could be seen. The likeness of their vessels has deceived more readers than the cipher.", ""], ["", "br"], ["In two chambers leave the question standing. Do not put a zero there to make the company complete.", ""]], "lh": 25.5, "para_gap": 9}, {"id": "fa_u", "x": 548, "y": 454.0, "w": 396, "size": 25, "font": "Zeyada", "color": "#4a463f", "runs": [["You have drawn the same face around every delay.", ""]], "lh": 27.5, "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "legend", "x": 56, "y": 706.96, "w": 888, "size": 12.2, "lh": 17.5, "font": "IBM Plex Mono", "para_gap": 0, "pre": true, "runs": [["UPPER HALF \u00b7 minutes between recorded stages. The endpoints differ and some overlap;", "#5a4331"], ["", "br"], ["these are not independent summands or comparable restoration times.", "#5a4331"], ["", "br"], [" ", ""], ["", "br"], ["110  Orange 2021  technical recognition \u2192 first supplier contact           OR1 pp 12\u201314", ""], ["", "br"], ["134  Orange 2021  recognition \u2192 supplier ticket                            OR1 pp 12\u201314", ""], ["", "br"], ["114  Orange 2021  internal escalation \u2192 supplier ticket                    OR1 pp 12\u201314", ""], ["", "br"], ["39   Fastly 2021  detection \u2192 configuration identified                     FA1", ""], ["", "br"], ["85   BT 2023      decision to use disaster recovery \u2192 successful transfer  BT1 \u00b64.29\u20134.35", ""], ["", "br"], ["7    BT 2023      the same decision \u2192 first attempt                        BT1 \u00b64.29\u20134.35", ""], ["", "br"], ["78   BT 2023      remainder, including failed execution and reversal       BT1 \u00b64.29\u20134.35", ""], ["", "br"], ["17   OVH 2021     emergency call \u2192 responders arrive                       OV1", ""], ["", "br"], [" ", ""], ["", "br"], ["